{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And you shall separate.</b> Some interpret it as והזרתם with the he missing, but this is impossible, for the he is not one of the letters of continuation, for [such a letter] would be dropped only at the end of the word. Rather its meaning is like ונזרו מקדשי בני ישראל, like והרחקתם, and from it [comes] nazir, who separated his soul from the desires of the world, and its pattern is והפלתם את הארץ, for the nun is assimilated with a dagesh." "<b>When you defile.</b> On account of their impurity, and its meaning is: when they defile my tabernacles."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "Resolved the unspecified 'some interpreters' literally without supplying identities."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:21.984668666Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}